WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.875
Step 1: Use the Categories sidebar to choose All categories or a saved category. Every article needs a category; older articles without one appear under Needs a category until they are edited.

2
00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:16.875
Step 2: With publishing authority, choose Manage categories to add, rename or remove one.

3
00:00:16.875 --> 00:00:22.875
Step 3: Select the appropriate category while editing an article.

4
00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:29.375
Step 4: Use the sidebar arrow to collapse it and choose Cards, List or Grid for the results.
